control: The serve-time pattern check reads the snippet and the attachment filenames that follow a gate-skipped body, and the filenames of every message, and they are released with the delimiters' words replaced
removes: the snippet and the filenames are released as they arrived, with the delimiters' words left in them
packages: ./api/internal/core/release
tests: TestTheCheckReadsEverythingReleased
scheduled-count: no

